Snitch website

Functional Requirements

1. User Can See all the Products.
2. User can add any product into the Cart.
3. A User can have one cart at any moment of the time.
4. Adding the same product into the cart increase the quantity instead of adding another entry for the same product.
5. User will Add the product with Size (e.g. XS, S, M, L, XL, XXL) into the Cart.
6. If Any size is currently out of stock show that size to user but label it Unavailable.
7. Seller can Unlist any product.
8. A Seller can list all the products on the Dashboard.
9. In the Cart Store the Reference of the product with size and quantity. Not the entire copy of the product.
10. If a user request to the seller API then return status code 403
11. If a guest user requested on a protected API then return 401 status code

Out of Scope

1. Live tracking of the Order
2. Payment Gateway
3. Refund Policy
4. Customer Support
5. Return Feature
